    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλάμ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμη</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (pl.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			= sq. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1631.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>: without diminutive sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μεγάλα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1742.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1181.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμια τῶν ὑποδέσεων,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγωγεῖς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				995.30
			</span></i>: sg., Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				784
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>splint</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.8
			</span></i>.</div>
